caption: Transformation
tradition-component: transformation

The Style fixes one construction:

Single Form: Choose one complete existing supernatural Species or creature template. It is an access menu; traits cost normal points. Eligible traits may be Switchable. Use the higher natural attribute cap of the character's Species or the selected form. No Species change, Species Class access, or mixing multiple templates.

Paired Animal Form: Choose exactly two complete mundane animal templates or Species. The practitioner may buy and combine legal traits from either. For attributes and secondary characteristics, use the best natural cap among the character and both animals. A Style with Paired Animal Form is an Animal Style. The Style may separately list supernatural animal traits as Post-Mastery or Zongshi access.
